{"turn_id": "language-2", "session_id": "mem-language", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "bls_data_used", "text": "作者将谷歌翻译的女性代词翻译统计与美国劳工统计局（BLS）关于各职业女性从业比例的数据进行了对比。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "no_correlation", "text": "作者比较了女性劳动者的分布与女性翻译的频率，发现这两个变量之间没有相关性。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "gt_fails_real_world", "text": "数据显示谷歌翻译的输出未能反映女性劳动者的真实分布。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "distribution_mismatch", "text": "谷歌翻译输出的女性代词分布与BLS呈现的真实分布不一致（BLS数据显示女性参与率在第四个12分位达到峰值，而翻译出的女性代词集中在第一个12分位）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "gender_neutral_languages_examples", "text": "研究所用的性别中立语言示例包括匈牙利语、中文、约鲁巴语等，共使用12种性别中立语言构建句子。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-b6caead3073704c5fbf5e230"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "language-2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": null, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
